#### All of these are:
* #### Generative AI tools
* #### Built using Large Language Models
* #### Accessed through an AI chatbot interface

#### Most consumer AI tools, including all of the above, are now **multimodal**, meaning they can work with more than just text. They can understand and create content using text, images, audio, and sometimes video.
